        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents A07-K6551, Traditional Style Door Knocker With Security Peephole</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Solid Brass Traditional Door Knocker With Eye Viewer features a classic Urn Tip design making it great for colonial style homes. It is made out of solid brass, so you can be sure that it will stand the test of time. Besides looking beautiful, this traditional front door knocker also features an peephole built right in, so you can safely see who is at your door, before you open it.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBrass Accents provides distinctive craftsmanship with old-world tradition for a lifetime of elegance. Their products are \r\nhand finished in the USA. They are one of the world's leading crafters of cast-brass and hot-forged decorative brass hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Traditional Door Knocker With Peephole\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 3-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Thickness: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
